00:00:20.954 --> 00:00:23.256
♪ Jon Hamm ♪

00:00:23.256 --> 00:00:25.257
♪ Big fan ♪

00:00:25.257 --> 00:00:27.326
♪ Of the hockey team
St. Louis Blues ♪

00:00:27.326 --> 00:00:29.662
♪ That's his jam ♪

00:00:29.662 --> 00:00:31.631
♪ Jon Hamm ♪

00:00:31.631 --> 00:00:33.666
♪ Mad man ♪

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:37.903
♪ When it's time to be Sergio,
he's a sax man ♪

00:00:37.903 --> 00:00:41.908
♪ Haaaam ♪

00:00:41.908 --> 00:00:44.677 line:0%
